   "text": "Phone 2877 Lenox.\nWhite Rose Working Girls' Home\n217 EAST 86TH STREET\nBet. Second and Third Avenues\nPleasant temporary lodgings for working girls,\nwith privileges, at reasonable rates. The Home\nsolicits orders for working dresses, aprons, etc.\nAddress:\nMRS. FRANCES R. KEYSER, Supt.\n\nHello, Central! Give me Harlem 3253.\n\nNEW YORK CAREFUL CLEAN-\nING BUREAU?\n\nYes, Madam! We clean from a rug to private\nhouse. Any time—by the hour, the day or the\njob. Oh, yes; we guarantee satisfaction. We are\nCleaners and Renovators for Particular People.\nLet us give you our estimate\n\n12 WEST 135th STREET",
